    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers in Excess of 275,000\n\nSituated in the popular holiday destination of Rosslare Strand, 12 Woodbrook presents an opportunity to own a 3 bedroomed detached dormer style house in a quiet cul de sac with a great front garden.\nSouthfields is located within easy reach of all the amenities of Rosslare Strand and is just 10 minutes south of Wexford town. The property is suitable as a permanent residence or holiday home. \nA healthy twelve minute walk brings you to the famous strand. There are children's play areas and fitness stations dotted around the estate.\nDownstairs accommodation comprises open plan kitchen / dining / living area with built-in units and open fire, an ensuite bedroom and a sunroom with access to a patio area and rear garden. Upstairs has a further two bedrooms (main has an ensuite and walk in fitted storage) and a family bathroom.\n\nAnnual maintaince fee is 350."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.11m x 1.27m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nOpen Plan Living / Kitchen Area - \n\n\nLiving Area - 4.87m x 3.7m\nWith tiled flooring, open fireplace and double door access into the sunroom.\n\nKitchen - 3.47m x 1.9m\nWith waist and eye leval storage and tiled flooring and splashbacks.\n\nSunroom - 3.8m x 2.54m\nWith tiled flooring and sliding doors to a rear patio area.\n\nDownstairs Bedroom Ensuite - 3.44m x 3m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.35m x .95m\nFully tiled with Triton T90 Electric shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nStore Cupboard - \n\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 4.3m x 1.3m\n\n\nHot Press - \n\n\nBathroom - 2.68m x 1.42m\nFully tiled wih bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 4.7m x 3.15m\nWith walk in fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - \nFully tiled with electric shower w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4m x 2.3m\nWith recessed shelving.\n\n"
      },
